# The Gradle wrapper IS committed so the project builds without a global Gradle
# installation. gradle-wrapper.jar is small (~43 KB) and pinned to Gradle 8.9.

# Bundled PWA assets are generated by scripts/sync-web.ps1 (or by CI from
# packages/dsh-mobile/web) and stay out of git. Only the placeholder is tracked.
app/src/main/assets/www/*
!app/src/main/assets/www/README.txt
